Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Pick one photo. Its three\Ndial readings give its energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}From that photo alone, the equations\Ntell how fast its energy changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Drop one marble per photo at that value.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Some photos are gaining energy,\Nothers losing it. The pile spreads wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Yet its average sits at zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:23.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Energy in equals energy out, on average.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Like a bank account: over the years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:31.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}income matches spending,\Nyet each day gains or loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:37.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}This is a {\c&H00A1ED&}law of the crowd{\c&HF7F4F2&}. It holds\Nfor the shoebox, not for each photo.
